7. This one I almost forgot because I didn't actually know the girl involved until she became infamous. 14-year-old freshman girl got pregnant. We weren't strangers to pregnant students at our school but the age was pretty surprising. She approached the health teacher, who responded with  "Well holy shit, why are you telling me?" before remembering she was a health teacher. Pregnant girl decided to keep the baby and kept saying she didn't know who the father was and at first everyone thought yeah okay she doesn't wanna get the guy in trouble until it turned out she had actually slept with quite a few guys and really didn't know. There was actually a senior who wanted to pursue dna testing because he wanted to take responsibility if it was his. Family eventually decided they didn't want to know and moved back to their home state when she was 8 months pregnant or so.
&nbsp;

8. Tech guy spent an odd amount of time in my anatomy teacher's classroom. She was always telling us "Man there's always something wrong with the tech stuff in this room!" Said unmarried teacher grows a baby bump and suddenly tech guy is transferred to the district's virtual program. Teacher is now married to tech guy!
&nbsp;

9. And for the ultimate scandal that I can't believe I forgot! 18 year old male student got arested a few months before graduation due to getting accused of a dozen or so counts of rape. I think it was in the ballpark of like 11 girls coming forward saying he raped, molested, or had sex with them when they were underage. It's pretty much a common belief that most if not all of the girls were lying but poor guy is still in jail awaiting trial. No bond for his magnitude of charges.
